// Windows resources compiled into the executable by build.rs.
//
// GPUI loads the window-class icon from resource id 1, and Explorer and the
// taskbar fall back to the executable's icon when no window icon is set.
// Keep the icon id at 1: `gpui-pre-windows` calls LoadImageW with PCWSTR(1).

1 ICON "assets/logo/Scico.ico"
